#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Quantum workflows often take a while to complete and can run over many sessions. Restarting your Python kernel means you'll lose any results stored in memory. To avoid loss of data, you can save results to file and retrieve results of past jobs from IBM Quantum&reg; so your next session can continue where you left off.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Alur kerja quantum seringkali membutuhkan waktu lama untuk selesai dan bisa berjalan di banyak sesi. Kalau Anda me-restart kernel Python, semua hasil yang tersimpan di memori akan hilang. Untuk menghindari kehilangan data, Anda bisa menyimpan hasil ke file dan mengambil hasil job-job sebelumnya dari IBM Quantum&reg; sehingga sesi berikutnya bisa melanjutkan dari tempat yang terakhir Anda tinggalkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve job results from IBM Quantum {#retrieve-job-results-from-ibm-quantum}"
msgstr "Ambil hasil job dari IBM Quantum {#retrieve-job-results-from-ibm-quantum}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum automatically stores results from every job for you to retrieve at a later date. Use this feature to continue quantum programs across kernel restarts and review past results. You can get the ID of a job programmatically through its `job_id` method, or you can see all your submitted jobs and their IDs on the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum secara otomatis menyimpan hasil dari setiap job agar bisa Anda ambil kapan saja. Gunakan fitur ini untuk melanjutkan program quantum setelah kernel di-restart dan meninjau hasil-hasil sebelumnya. Anda bisa mendapatkan ID sebuah job secara programatik melalui metode `job_id`-nya, atau Anda bisa melihat semua job yang sudah Anda kirimkan beserta ID-nya di [halaman Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To find a job programmatically, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) method. By default, this returns the most recently submitted jobs, but you can also filter jobs by backend name, creation date, and more. The following cell finds any jobs submitted in the last three months. The `created_after` argument must be a [`datetime.datetime`](https://docs.python.org/3.8/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime) object.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mencari job secara programatik, gunakan metode [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs). Secara default, ini mengembalikan job-job yang paling baru dikirimkan, tapi Anda juga bisa memfilter job berdasarkan nama Backend, tanggal pembuatan, dan lainnya. Cell berikut mencari job yang dikirimkan dalam tiga bulan terakhir. Argumen `created_after` harus berupa objek [`datetime.datetime`](https://docs.python.org/3.8/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also select by backend, job state, session, and more. For more information, see [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) in the API documentation.\n"
msgstr "Anda juga bisa memilih berdasarkan Backend, status job, Session, dan lainnya. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) di dokumentasi API.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have the job ID, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.job`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#job) method to retrieve it.\n"
msgstr "Setelah Anda punya ID job, gunakan metode [`QiskitRuntimeService.job`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#job) untuk mengambilnya.\n"

